	(text_box "NOTES\n\nUSB\n===\nWe use USB-C sockets which does not work with OTG and does not have the ID pin.\nSo we enforce USB1 to be 'peripheral', USB2 to be 'host'\n\nUSB OTG1 ID and USB_OTG2_ID do not exist on our SOC\nUSB_OTG1_CHD_B should be left floating/NC. It notifies a PMIC if a charger is connected but we use discrete power\n\n\nUSB_OTG1_VBUS powers internal LDO_USB from main input\nUSB_OTG2_VBUS = NC\n\n\nBOOT\n====\nBOOT_MODE0 and BOOT_MODE1 have jumpers\n\nThese pins connect to a smart PMIC which we do not have.\nJust adding test points. Not sure how to setup pullups\nSNVS_PMIC_ON_REQ\nCCM_PMIC_STBY_REQ"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.36 15.24 0)
		(size 68.58 55.88)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
